{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "count-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 4240,
      "height": 230,
      "text": "# 组合计数原理\n\n先定义一个结果是什么，再选择分类、分阶段构造、对应、容量论证或序列编码。通用概念节点只回答“它是什么”；恒等式、定理和有限误差界各自成为可单独链接的原子。\n\n**本图显示精选学习关系，不机械展开全部双链。25 张原子的颜色只表示语义角色，不表示掌握度。**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-classify",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 建模、分类与重叠\n先固定对象；互斥时相加，重叠时容斥，截断时只得到一侧界。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 分阶段构造与阶乘\n固定延伸数给乘法；有序无重复选择产生排列与阶乘。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-choice",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 对应、去重与组合数\n可逆编码先排除遗漏；等纤维再除去重复表示。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-multi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 多类分配\n多项式系数处理有标签多组；隔板法处理不可区分单位的定和分配。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-proof",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Identities and existence\n\nDouble counting equates two totals; pigeonhole forces one box to contain enough objects.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n恒等式与存在性：双重计数比较同一总量，鸽巢原理保证至少一个盒子达到一定数量。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-group-series",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 序列编码与增长\n生成函数编码整列计数；几何和与调和数展示不同的累积尺度。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-object",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[计数对象|Objects being counted]]\n\nDefine when two outcomes count as the same: labels, order, repetition and constraints.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n计数对象：先明确标签、顺序、重复、约束，以及怎样才算同一个结果。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-add",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[加法法则|Sum rule]]\n\nSplit a finite set into disjoint cases, then add their sizes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限结果分成互不重叠的类别，再把各类数量相加。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-inclusion",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[容斥原理|Inclusion–exclusion]]\n\nFor finitely many sets, correct all overlaps so each union member contributes once. The probability version does not require equally likely outcomes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n容斥原理：对有限多个集合逐层修正重叠，让并集元素各计一次；概率版本不要求结果等可能。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-bonferroni",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Bonferroni界|Bonferroni bounds]]\n\nTruncate inclusion–exclusion: odd orders give upper bounds and even orders lower bounds. Higher orders need not improve the same-side bound.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n奇数阶上界、偶数阶下界；有时提前精确，更高阶未必比同侧旧界更紧。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘法法则|Product rule]]\n\nWhen every prefix at a stage has the same number of extensions, multiply the counts across stages.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一阶段的每个合法前缀都有固定延伸数时，可按阶段相乘。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-permutation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[排列|Permutations]]\n\nOrdered selections without repetition from distinct objects. Empty selection counts once.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n排列：从不同对象中作有序、无重复选择；空选择计一种。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-stirling",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[斯特林公式]]\nMCS-COUNT-016 · 渐近定理\n\n以相对误差趋零的主式近似阶乘。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-robbins",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[Robbins阶乘界]]\nMCS-COUNT-024 · 有限界\n\n为每个正整数 n 给出显式 Stirling 余项范围。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-bijection",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双射计数|Counting by bijection]]\n\nAn explicit inverse shows no outcomes are lost or duplicated.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n构造可逆对应，说明计数既不遗漏，也不重复。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-division",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[除法法则|Division rule]]\n\nIf every target has exactly $k>0$ representations, divide the representation count by $k$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先证明每个目标恰有 $k$ 个表示，再除以这个共同重数。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-combination",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[组合数|Binomial coefficients]]\n\nCount k-element subsets of n distinct objects. Each subset has k! orderings.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n组合数：计数 n 个不同对象的 k 元子集；每个子集对应 k! 种排列。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-symmetry",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[组合数对称性|Symmetry of binomial coefficients]]\n\nTaking the complement pairs each k-subset with an (n−k)-subset; constraints must transform too.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n组合数对称性：取补集将 k 元与 n−k 元子集配对；附加条件也必须随之转换。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-pascal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Pascal恒等式|Pascal’s identity]]\n\nFor $n\\ge1$, split $k$-subsets by whether they contain one chosen element. The two disjoint counts add.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对非负整数大小的子集，按是否包含一个指定元素分成两类，再相加。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-binomial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[二项式定理|Binomial theorem]]\n\nFor integer $n\\ge0$, choosing which factors supply each term gives the coefficients in $(x+y)^n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非负整数次幂中，选择哪些因子贡献哪一项，得到展开系数。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-multinomial",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多项式系数|Multinomial coefficients]]\n\nCount allocations of distinct objects into labelled groups of prescribed nonnegative integer sizes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n计数不同对象分入有标签组、且各组大小预先给定的分配。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-multitheorem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多项式定理|Multinomial theorem]]\n\nFor a nonnegative integer power, group products by how often each summand is selected.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对非负整数次幂，按每个加数被选中的次数归并乘积。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-stars",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隔板法|Stars and bars]]\n\nEncode $k\\ge1$ labelled nonnegative counts summing to $n\\ge0$ by $n$ stars and $k-1$ bars.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n把有标签的非负整数计数编码为星与隔板；空组允许相邻隔板。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-double",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双重计数|Double counting]]\n\nCount the same finite set in two complete ways to prove an identity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对同一个有限集合，用两种完整的计数方式得到恒等式。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-pigeon",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2480,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[鸽巢原理|Pigeonhole principle]]\n\n$N$ objects in $k\\ge1$ boxes: some box has at least $\\lceil N/k\\rceil$ objects.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保证某个盒子达到这个数量，不指定哪个盒子，也不要求等概率。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-ogf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[普通生成函数|Ordinary generating function]]\n\nIn $A(x)=\\sum a_nx^n$, the power records an index and the coefficient stores its value. Formal operations need no numerical substitution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n次数记录索引，系数记录数列项；形式运算与数值收敛分开。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-convolution",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[生成函数乘积与卷积|Coefficient convolution]]\n\n$[x^n](AB)=\\sum_{k=0}^n a_kb_{n-k}$. Counting completed objects requires a unique valid component decomposition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定总次数，累加全部规模拆分；解释为完成品计数还需要唯一合法分解。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-geometric",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[几何和|Finite geometric sum]]\n\nAdd $n+1$ terms from index 0 through $n$; at ratio 1 count copies directly. Infinite summation requires [[几何级数|series convergence]].\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限和不要求公比绝对值小于1；项数与最后索引要分开。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-harmonic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[调和数|Harmonic numbers]]\n\n$H_n=\\sum_{k=1}^n1/k$, with $H_0=0$. Each is a finite sum; its growth is a separate question.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n前n个正整数的倒数之和；不含1/0。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-weighted-geometric",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3720,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[加权几何和|Weighted geometric sum]]\n\nFor $\\sum_{i=1}^n ir^i$, differentiate the finite geometric polynomial, then multiply by $r$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先求导产生位置权重，再乘回变量恢复指数；公比1时直接等差求和。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-harmonic-growth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3100,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[调和数对数增长|Logarithmic harmonic growth]]\n\nFor $n\\ge1$, integral comparison gives $\\ln(n+1)\\le H_n\\le1+\\ln n$: $H_n\\sim\\ln n$ and grows without bound.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nn≥1时适用上述界；比值趋于1仍然可以发散；与对数之差不趋于零。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "count-asymptotic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3720,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[渐近记号与算法复杂度.canvas|渐近记号与算法复杂度]]\n跨主题出口\n\n在对象与公式固定后，比较它们随规模怎样增长。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-pgf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3720,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[概率生成函数|Probability generating function]]\n\nFor a nonnegative integer count, $G(s)=\\sum P(N=n)s^n$. Its coefficients are nonnegative and sum to one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n用概率作系数，记录非负整数计数分布；单位圆盘内保证绝对收敛。"
    }
  ],
